# Component reuse (mandatory)

This app uses **shadcn/ui** (`src/components/ui/*`). Treat it as the design system.

Also follow **modular-ui.mdc**: split by region (sidebar / modal / pane), make components configurable (`className` + props), desktop-first adaptive layout.

## Before writing markup

1. Search `src/components/ui/` and `src/components/editor/` for an existing primitive or feature component.
2. If missing from the repo but exists in shadcn: run `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` — do **not** hand-roll a parallel Button/Dialog/Input.
3. Compose: `Dialog` + `Field` + `Input` + `Button`, not custom modal CSS.
4. Prefer variants (`variant="outline"`, `size="sm"`) over `className` color overrides.
5. If the UI is a **region** (sidebar, inspector, toolbar, modal body) — new file under `editor/` or `editor/dialogs/`, not inline in `PlanEditor`.

## Hard rules

| Need | Use | Do not |
|------|-----|--------|
| Click action | `Button` | `<button className="…">` |
| Modal | `AppDialog` + `editor/dialogs/*Dialog` | custom backdrop/modal CSS; inline modal JSX in PlanEditor |
| Form field | `Field` + `FieldLabel` + control | naked label + input stacks |
| Tabs | `Tabs` / `TabsList` / `TabsTrigger` / `TabsContent` | manual tab buttons |
| Status chip | `Badge` / `TypeBadge` / `ValidationBadge` | ad-hoc spans |
| Lists | `ScrollArea` + buttons/items | unstyled overflow divs only |
| Divider | `Separator` | `<hr>` / border-only divs |
| Toast | `toast` from `sonner` | `alert()` for non-blocking info |
| Icons | `lucide-react` + `data-icon` on Button | emoji / inline SVG duplicates |
| class merge | `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` | string concat ternaries |

## Styling

- Layout/spacing only in `className` (`flex`, `gap-*`, `grid`, widths) + responsive prefixes (`lg:`, `xl:`).
- Colors via semantic tokens: `bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`.
- No `space-y-*` / `space-x-*` — use `flex` + `gap-*`.
- No raw palette classes for status (`text-emerald-500`); use `Badge` variants or `--success` / `--warn` tokens already in theme.
- Never edit `src/components/ui/*` for one-off product looks — wrap in `src/components/editor/`.

## File discipline

- New reusable chrome → `src/components/editor/<Name>.tsx` exporting a named component.
- Modals → `src/components/editor/dialogs/<Name>Dialog.tsx`.
- Keep domain logic in `src/lib/plan/` and call it from editor components.
- If a panel grows past ~250 lines of JSX, split it before adding more features.
- Every feature component: **`className?: string`** on the root + behaviour via props (see modular-ui.mdc).
